+# Plan
+
+## Constraints
+- Domain layer only: no IO, no new dependencies; do not modify `bundle.py` or other existing modules.
+- Python typing strict style of the repo; deterministic output (no time/random).
+- Tests first, seen failing, then code. Every task leaves the suite green.
+- Test file for all tasks: `backend/tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py`; code in
+  `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/corpus/authoring.py`.
+
+## Task 1: slugify and section_key
+Files: create authoring.py, test_authoring.py. Uses: nothing. Provides: `slugify`, `section_key`.
+Test: `Đường uống`→`duong-uong`, max_length cut, `section_key("c:d", ())`=`c:d#body`, path joined by `/`.
+
+## Task 2: split_markdown
+Files: authoring.py, test_authoring.py. Uses: BlockRecord/BlockKind. Provides: `MarkdownSection`, `split_markdown`.
+Test: fenced `#` ignored, preamble/fallback, empty sections dropped, paths/ordinals, tables `t1,t2` across sections, prose stripped.
+
+## Task 3: section_choices and build_bundle
+Files: authoring.py, test_authoring.py. Uses: tasks 1–2. Provides: `AuthoredDocument`, `section_choices`, `build_bundle`.
+Test: key prefixing/sorting, labels with ` › `, colloquial filtering, manifest, duplicate-key disambiguation,
+identical digests on repeat, `write_bundle` + `read_bundle` round trip.
